<!--
  Default profile avatar, shown until the login response's profileImageBase64 is decoded in.

  The fill is a baked neutral slate rather than a theme attribute on purpose: this drawable sits in
  an ImageView whose image is later REPLACED by the user's real photo, so the view must not carry an
  android:tint (that would recolor the photo too). This gray reads on both the light and navy
  backgrounds.
-->
